``` Lab 02 - Zeek conn.log variant. S0/REJ/RSTO states = unanswered or refused connections, typical of SYN scans. ```
index=zeek sourcetype=zeek:conn conn_state IN ("S0","REJ","RSTOS0","RSTR","SH")
| bin _time span=5m
| stats dc(id.resp_p) as distinct_ports count as attempts values(conn_state) as states by _time id.orig_h id.resp_h
| where distinct_ports >= 20
